Medicare Advantage coverage, provider networks, benefits, and costs can change. Always verify your current plan requirements with your insurance company and the counseling practice before receiving services. Coverage decisions are subject to applicable Medicare rules and your individual plan documents.

For official information, visit Medicare.gov.

